{
  "comment": [
    "Scenarios that cross the seam between the media library and the renderer.",
    "",
    "Each entry describes what a media centre reports about a file, what the",
    "library should conclude from it, and what the wearer should then see. The",
    "two ends are tested in different languages and different processes \u2014 the",
    "Kotlin side asserts the first half, the Rust side the second \u2014 so this file",
    "is what keeps them agreeing. Change one side's behaviour and the other",
    "side's test fails, which is the point.",
    "",
    "packing:    0 monoscopic, 1 over-under, 2 side-by-side, 3 anaglyph,",
    "            4 row-interleaved",
    "projection: 0 full sphere, 1 VR180 front hemisphere, 2 a flat screen,",
    "            3 a cube map",
    "swapEyes:   the eyes are the other way round from what the packing implies",
    "            \u2014 the right_left, bottom_top and _rl variants",
    "anaglyphPair: 0 cyan/red, 1 green/magenta, 2 yellow/blue; only meaningful",
    "            for an anaglyph packing",
    "verdict:    GUESSED weakest, then CATALOGUED, DECLARED, CHOSEN",
    "centreUv:   what the middle of the panel samples, per eye, looking straight",
    "            ahead. Exact, because the middle of an equirectangular image is",
    "            straight ahead by definition and the stereo window is a fixed",
    "            transform on top.",
    "",
    "            Two packings have no window: anaglyph and row-interleaved cover",
    "            the whole frame with both eyes and separate them per pixel, in",
    "            the fragment shader. Their centreUv is therefore the same for",
    "            both eyes, and that is a statement about where the geometry",
    "            samples, not a claim that the eyes see the same thing.",
    "            Where swapEyes is set, centreUv is what each eye actually",
    "            sees \u2014 already swapped. That is the whole content of the flag,",
    "            so stating it any other way would test nothing."
  ],
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "name": "a monoscopic sphere the catalogue scanned",
      "kodi": {
        "label": "Reef",
        "width": 3840,
        "height": 1920,
        "stereomode": "mono"
      },
      "expect": {
        "packing": 0,
        "projection": 0,
        "verdict": "CATALOGUED"
      },
      "centreUv": {
        "left": [
          0.5,
          0.5
        ],
        "right": [
          0.5,
          0.5
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an over-under sphere the catalogue scanned",
      "kodi": {
        "label": "Dive",
        "width": 3840,
        "height": 3840,
        "stereomode": "top_bottom"
      },
      "expect": {
        "packing": 1,
        "projection": 0,
        "verdict": "CATALOGUED"
      },
      "centreUv": {
        "left": [
          0.5,
          0.75
        ],
        "right": [
          0.5,
          0.25
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a side-by-side VR180 recording",
      "kodi": {
        "label": "Concert",
        "width": 7680,
        "height": 3840,
        "stereomode": "left_right"
      },
      "expect": {
        "packing": 2,
        "projection": 1,
        "verdict": "CATALOGUED"
      },
      "centreUv": {
        "left": [
          0.25,
          0.5
        ],
        "right": [
          0.75,
          0.5
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an over-under VR180 recording",
      "kodi": {
        "label": "Garden",
        "width": 3840,
        "height": 7680,
        "stereomode": "top_bottom"
      },
      "expect": {
        "packing": 1,
        "projection": 1,
        "verdict": "CATALOGUED"
      },
      "centreUv": {
        "left": [
          0.5,
          0.75
        ],
        "right": [
          0.5,
          0.25
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an unscanned file whose name states the packing",
      "kodi": {
        "label": "Holiday_TB.mkv",
        "width": 0,
        "height": 0,
        "stereomode": null
      },
      "expect": {
        "packing": 1,
        "projection": 2,
        "verdict": "GUESSED"
      },
      "centreUv": {
        "left": [
          0.5,
          0.75
        ],
        "right": [
          0.5,
          0.25
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an empty stereo mode does not outrank a marked name",
      "kodi": {
        "label": "Holiday_TB.mkv",
        "width": 3840,
        "height": 1920,
        "stereomode": ""
      },
      "expect": {
        "packing": 1,
        "projection": 2,
        "verdict": "GUESSED"
      },
      "centreUv": {
        "left": [
          0.5,
          0.75
        ],
        "right": [
          0.5,
          0.25
        ]
      }
    },
